            <span class="chevron" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
        </h2>
        <div class="details" id="faq-1">
          <p>Cats purr when they feel content, but they also use it to self-soothe, communicate, and recover from stress.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

